ssionManager` implementations; if so, approve the exhaustion/coverage exception, otherwise add a realistic path that reaches it.\n3. Re-run the coordinate’s `test` and `generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport` tasks after resolving the coverage decision, then complete finalization.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_010d3bb13ed6757e016a9aabaddc4087d287bf5076bc0875aa\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 902, "output": 1417, "cacheRead": 169088, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 925, "totalTokens": 171407, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1788521369670, "responseId": "resp_010d3bb13ed6757e016a9aab9a67bc87d293b7fea4a75619ee", "rawStopReason": "completed"}}
